<title>FRANCE: France postpones food aid tenders - ONIC.</title>
<headline>France postpones food aid tenders - ONIC.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>France has postponed two tenders to ship 8,250 tonnes of maize to Cape Verde and 3,650 tonnes of soft wheat flour to Sierra Leone as food aid, national grain office ONIC said on Monday.</p>
<p>The maize and the flour were for shipment between January 13 and February 1, 1997.</p>
<p>France was scheduled to hold the tenders on December 19.</p>
<p>ONIC did not say if or when France planned to hold new tenders.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
